      "widgets_values": [
        "### Models\n\n```\ndiffusion_models/\n  minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\ntext_encoders/MiniMax-H3/\n  qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_ultra_uncensored_heretic-Q4_0.gguf\nvae/\n  minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n```\n\nThe text encoder loads via **GGUF CLIP Loader** (`type: minimax`).\nSwap to the stock `CLIPLoader` if you use a safetensors encoder.\n"
      ],
